{
  "_id": "tg-cast",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Cast out this bondwoman, Gen. 21:10 (Gal. 4:30). I will cast out the nations before thee, Ex. 34:24 (Deut. 7:1). They … cast lots upon my vesture, Ps. 22:18 (Matt. 27:35; Mark 15:24; Luke 23:34; John 19:24). Cast thy burden upon the Lord, Ps. 55:22. Will the Lord cast off for ever, Ps. 77:7. thou hast cast out the heathen, Ps. 80:8. the Lord will not cast off his people, Ps. 94:14. that day a man shall cast his idols of silver, Isa. 2:20 (2 Ne. 12:20). thou hast cast all my sins behind thy back, Isa. 38:17. I have chosen thee, and not cast thee away, Isa. 41:9. Therefore will I cast you out of this land, Jer. 16:13. I will also cast off all the seed of Israel, Jer. 31:37. I have cast them far off among the heathen, Ezek. 11:16. Cast away from you all your transgressions, Ezek. 18:31. cast into … furnace, Dan. 3:6 (3 Ne. 28:21; 4 Ne. 1:32). I beheld till the thrones were cast down, Dan. 7:9. the place of his sanctuary was cast down, Dan. 8:11. thou wilt cast all their sins into the depths, Micah 7:19.",
